I left out both operations requests. This node's contract declares only `kb-read`, and the two requests would each need a new capability. A log write needs filesystem access, which this wasm32-unknown-unknown build doesn't have. The metadata fetch needs an `http-client` import, and it would send the customer's question text to an external host. Adding either would widen what the node can do beyond what the graph declares, so it should go through a separate, reviewed change to the node's capabilities.

